      <activity id="6c675061-82e2-5a53-91cf-09db1303f486" activityNameId="0ba1c59b-2273-5c78-8aab-e21b2b27bdff" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Clinker, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Clinker, at plant
The dataset describes the production of portland cement ;
UUID: 137152eb-d111-382a-9eae-3e592047418d
Included activities start from  the reception of traditional and alternative fuels and raw materials at the factory gate and it ends with the cooling of the produced clinker. the infrastructure of cement production facility is inventoried in the cement production dataset; the infrastructure inventoried in this dataset comprises the rotary kiln, refractory clay and some wear and tear parts made from steel.
Location: undefined
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Measured data of several Swiss plants, intended to be representative for the Swiss production volume 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_137152eb-d111-382a-9eae-3e592047418d.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
